  "scenario": "Set RX interrupt watchdog to 64 with TX interrupt policy at default. Compare four 8-second IPv4 streams to default and run 512 individual 512-byte UDP request/echo pairs before, during and after the setting.",
  "expected": "Receive isolated UDP packets without subsequent test traffic, observe non-IOC processing, and reduce receive interrupt rate.",
  "observed": "All UDP sequences were returned in the three phases. During the trial 366 non-IOC receive frames were counted and none of the 512 request-to-echo windows contained other captured ingress. TCP receive increased from 914.38 to 923.76 Mbit/s while EQOS interrupts decreased from about 100,947 to 63,482 per second.",
